{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/t81dev/t81-foundation/pulls/565","id":4999949570,"node_id":"PR_kwDOQajdIs8AAAABKgUtAg","html_url":"https://github.com/t81dev/t81-foundation/pull/565","diff_url":"https://github.com/t81dev/t81-foundation/pull/565.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/t81dev/t81-foundation/pull/565.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/t81dev/t81-foundation/issues/565","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/t81dev/t81-foundation/pulls/565/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/t81dev/t81-foundation/pulls/565/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/t81dev/t81-foundation/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/t81dev/t81-foundation/issues/565/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/t81dev/t81-foundation/statuses/736e4fd9754936b4851564881cfb244e359d916e","number":565,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"fix(security): fail closed before controlled AI inference dispatch","user":{"login":"t81dev","id":207451414,"node_id":"U_kgDODF11Fg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/207451414?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/t81dev","html_url":"https://github.com/t81dev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/t81dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/t81dev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/t81dev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/t81dev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/t81dev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/t81dev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/t81dev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/t81dev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/t81dev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"The controlled backend previously dispatched simulated inference after Deny, Defer, Warn, Quarantine, missing policy and null engine, and attributed decisions to the previous operation. The original #564 probe reproduced all six failures before source edits. This separate production security correction requires an engine-owned active policy and an exact Axion Allow at the existing final-authorization boundary before either dispatch routine.\n\nThe backend now records each operation's exact verdict, request context and failure reason. Policy approval is distinct from consent: consent-required calls fail closed with ERR_AI_CONSENT_UNSUPPORTED because no verified-consent contract exists. The existing require_user_consent=false option explicitly selects policy-only operation and never sets user_consent=true. Direct API keeps the consent-required default, propagates failure, rejects empty initial cache keys/uninitialized use, recreates engines on validated policy cache hits, and invalidates stale backends after failed initialization. Shared JSON string escaping preserves quoted/control-character reasons.\n\nValidation on macOS ARM64 / Apple Clang 21:\n- 7/7 registered focused CTests pass: three new backend/Direct API/evidence tests and four existing Axion/CanonFS regressions.\n- Negative matrix covers 30 non-Allow and 12 missing-policy/engine mode/route combinations, plus absent-policy custom Allow, evaluation exceptions, final-evidence denial and consent rejection. Real configured Axion Allow succeeds only in explicitly selected policy-only mode.\n- Optimized NDEBUG wrapper test and targeted ASan/UBSan wrapper test pass. Dependencies were not fully sanitizer-rebuilt.\n- Disabling the gate in a temporary source copy makes the regression test fail. Original unsafe probe expectations no longer hold after correction.\n- Strict warning syntax scan, existing adapter/boundary scripts, diff checks and commit-time bundle validation pass. Six pre-existing optional -Wconversion failures remain in random-seed/float code; no controls or warning settings were weakened.\n\nEngineering report, exact commands, before/after output and limitations: docs/reports/CONTROLLED_AI_BACKEND_SECURITY_REMEDIATION.md.\n\n**Blocking limitation:** no claim of consent-governed inference is supported. Default backend/Direct API calls remain blocked pending an actual verified-consent contract. Dispatch remains simulated; real external effects, concurrent/reentrant use, durable/signed evidence and Linux/Windows native execution are unverified. This changes constructor/object ABI; rebuild consumers.\n\nBased directly on main, independent of draft #564. No Research Protocol 001 methodology, frozen ISA, Axion evaluation semantics or unrelated VM behavior changes. Keep draft for independent review. Do not merge automatically.","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-24T23:03:07Z","updated_at":"2026-10-25T01:28:20Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"06030c7447b1645434895b6877c510d23f87bce6","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"t81dev:security/controlled-ai-authorization","ref":"security/controlled-ai-authorization","repo":{"id":1101585698,"node_id":"R_kgDOQajdIg","name":"t81-foundation","full_name":"t81dev/t81-foundation","owner":{"login":"t81dev","id":207451414,"node_id":"U_kgDODF11Fg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/207451414?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/t81dev","html_url":"https://github.com/t81dev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/t81dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/t81dev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/t81dev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/t81dev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/t81dev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/t81dev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/t81dev/repos","events_url":"http